#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; lets you explore the night sky from the comfort of your computer "
"chair. It provides an accurate graphical representation of the night sky for "
"any date, from any location on Earth. The display includes 126,000 stars to "
"9th magnitude (well below the naked-eye limit), 13,000 deep-sky objects "
"(Messier, NGC, and IC catalogs), all planets, the Sun and Moon, hundreds of "
"comets and asteroids, the Milky Way, 88 constellations, and guide lines such "
"as the <link linkend=\"ai-cequator\">celestial equator</link>, the <link "
"linkend=\"ai-horizon\">horizon</link> and the <link linkend=\"ai-ecliptic"
"\">ecliptic</link>."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; omogućava vam da istražite noćno nebo iz udobnosti vaše računarske "
"stolice. Daje precizan grafički prikaz noćnog neba za bilo koji datum, s "
"bilo koje lokacije na Zemlji. Ekran sadrži 126.000 zvijezda do 9. magnitude "
"(i ispod granice golim okom), 13.000 dubokih nebeskih objekata (Messier, "
"NGC, i IC katalozi), sve planete, Sunce i Mjesec, stotine kometa i "
"asteroida, Mliječni putu , 88 sazviježđa, i linija vodiča, kao što je <link "
"linkend=\"ai-cequator\">nebeski ekvator</link>, the <link linkend=\"ai-"
"horizon\">horizont</link> i <link linkend=\"ai-ecliptic\">ekliptika</link>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, &kstars; is more than a simple night-sky simulator. The display "
"provides a compelling interface to a number of tools with which you can "
"learn more about astronomy and the night sky. There is a context-sensitive "
"<link linkend=\"popup-menu\">popup menu</link> attached to each displayed "
"object, which displays object-specific information and actions. Hundreds of "
"objects provide links in their popup menus to informative web pages and "
"beautiful images taken by the Hubble Space Telescope and other observatories."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, &kstars; je više nego jednostavan simulator noćnog neba. Ekran daje "
"potpun interfejs za niz alata sa kojima možete saznati više o astronomiji i "
"o noćnom nebu. Postoje kontekstualne <link linkend =\"popup-menu\"> popup "
"menu</link> prikačen uz svaki objekat, koji prikazuje informacije i postupke "
"specifične za objekt. Stotine objekata somogućavaju u svojim popup "
"izbornicima ,informativnim web stranicama i lijepe slike koje su snimljene "
"pomoću Hubble Space Telescope i drugih opservatorija."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:213
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From an object's popup menu, you can open its <link linkend=\"tool-details"
"\">Detailed Information Window</link>, where you can examine positional data "
"about the object, and query a huge treasury of online databases for "
"professional-grade astronomical data and literature references about the "
"object. You can even attach your own Internet links, images and text notes, "
"making &kstars; a graphical front-end to your observing logs and your "
"personal astronomical notebook."
msgstr ""
"Iz objekta padajućeg menija, možete otvoriti svoje <link linkend=\"tool-"
"details\">Detaljne informacije o prozoru</link>, gdje možete pregledati "
"položajne podatke o objektu i upite o ogromnoj online riznici baza podataka "
"za profesionalne-razredne astronomskih podataka i  reference literature za "
"objektu. Možete čak i priložiti svoje Internet veze, slike i tekst bilješke, "
"čineći &kstars; grafički početak-kraj za svoje posmatranje i svoje lične "
"astronomske bilješke."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Our <link linkend=\"tool-calculator\">Astrocalculator</link> tool provides "
"direct access to many of the algorithms the program uses behind the scenes, "
"including coordinate converters and time calculators."
msgstr ""
"Naš <link linkend=\"tool-calculator\">Astro kalkulator</link> alat koji "
"omogućuje izravan pristup mnogim algoritama koje programkoristi iza scene, "
"uključujući i koordinate pretvarača i vremenski kalkulatori."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can plan an observing session using our <link linkend=\"tool-altvstime"
"\">Altitude vs. Time</link> tool, which will plot curves representing the "
"Altitude as a function of time for any group of objects. If that is too much "
"detail, we also provide a <link linkend=\"tool-whatsup\">What's Up Tonight?</"
"link> tool that summarizes the objects that you will be able to see from "
"your location on any given night. You can add your favorite objects to your "
"observing wish-list using the <link linkend=\"tool-obsplanner\">Observation "
"Planner</link> tool, which allows you to plan your observation sessions "
"professionally."
msgstr ""
"Možete planirati i sesije promatranja koristeći naše <link linkend=\"tool-"
"altvstime\">Visina vs. Vrijeme</link>alat, koji će iscrtati krivulje koje "
"predstavljaju visinu kao funkciju vremena za bilo koju grupu objekata. Ako "
"je to previše detalja, mi takođe pružamo <link linkend=\"tool-whatsup"
"\">What's Up Tonight?</link> alat koji sumira objekte koji ćete moći vidjeti "
"od svoje lokacije svake noći. Možete dodati svoje omiljene objekte za vaše "
"poštovane liste želja pomoću <link linkend=\"tool-obsplanner\">Planer "
"opažanja</link> alat, koji vam omogućava da isplanirate sesije opažanja "
"profesionalno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; also provides a <link linkend=\"tool-solarsys\">Solar System "
"Viewer</link>, which shows the current configuration of the major planets in "
"our solar system. There is also a <link linkend=\"tool-jmoons\">Jupiter "
"Moons Tool</link> which shows the positions of Jupiter's four largest moons "
"as a function of time."
msgstr ""
"&kstars; također pruža <link linkend=\"tool-solarsys\">Prikaz solarnog "
"sistema</link>, koji pokazuje trenutnu konfiguraciju glavnih planeta u "
"Sunčevom sistemu. Tu je i  <link linkend=\"tool-jmoons\">Jupiter Moons Tool</"
"link> koja pokazuje pozicije Jupiterova četiri najveća meseca kao funkcija "
"vremena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Our primary goal is to make &kstars; an interactive educational tool for "
"learning about astronomy and the night sky. To this end, the &kstars; "
"Handbook includes the <link linkend=\"astroinfo\">AstroInfo Project</link>, "
"a series of short, hyperlinked articles on astronomical topics that can be "
"explored with &kstars;. In addition, &kstars; includes &DBus; functions that "
"allow you to <link linkend=\"tool-scriptbuilder\">write complex scripts</"
"link>, making &kstars; a powerful \"demo engine\" for classroom use or "
"general illustration of astronomical topics."
msgstr ""
"Naš primarni cilj je napraviti &kstars; interaktivni obrazovni alat za "
"učenje o astronomiji i o noćnom nebu. U tu svrhu, na &kstars; Priručnik "
"podrazumijeva <link linkend=\"astroinfo\">AstroInfo Projekat</link>, niz "
"kratkih, hiperlink članaka o astronomskim temama koje se mogu istražiti s "
"&kstars;. Osim toga, &kstars; uključuje &DBus; funkcije koje ti dopuštaju "
"da  <link linkend=\"tool-scriptbuilder\">pisanje složenih skripti</link>, "
"pravljenje&kstars; snažan \"demo motor\" za upotrebu u učionici ili za opšte "
"ilustraciju astronomske teme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"However, &kstars; is not just for students. You can control telescopes and "
"cameras with &kstars;, using the elegant and powerful <link linkend=\"indi"
"\">INDI</link> protocol. &kstars; supports several popular telescopes "
"including Meade's LX200 family and Celestron GPS. Several popular CCD "
"cameras, webcams, and computerized focusers are also supported. Simple slew/"
"track commands are integrated directly into the main window's popup menu, "
"and the INDI Control Panel provides full access to all of your telescope's "
"functions. INDI's Client/Server architecture allows for seamless control of "
"any number of <link linkend=\"indi-kstars-setup\">local</link> or <link "
"linkend=\"indi-remote-control\">remote</link> telescopes using a single "
"&kstars; session."
msgstr ""
"Međutim, &kstars; nije samo za student. Možete kontrolisati teleskope i "
"kamere sa &kstars;, koristeći elenatni i jaki<link linkend=\"indi\">INDI</"
"link> protokol. &kstars; podržava nekoliko popularnih teleskopa, uključujući "
"Meade LX200 porodicu i Celestron GPS. Nekoliko popularnih CCD kamera, a "
"kompjuterizovane focusers su također podržani. Jednostavno komande pogubio / "
"track su integrirane izravno u padajući meni glavnog prozora, a INDI Control "
"Panel daje puni pristup svim funkcijama vašeg teleskopa. Klijent/server "
"arhitektura Indi omogućava potpunu kontrolu bilo kojeg broja<link linkend="
"\"indi-kstars-setup\">local</link> or <link linkend=\"indi-remote-control"
"\">daljinski</link> teleskope koristeći samo &kstars; session."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"We are very interested in your feedback; please report bugs or feature "
"requests to the &kstars; development mailing list: <email>kstars-devel@kde."
"org</email>. You can also use the automated bug reporting tool, accessible "
"from the Help menu."
msgstr ""
"Mi smo mnogo zainteresirani za vaše mišljenje; molimo prijavite grešku ili "
"buduće upine na &kstars; razvojna mailing lista: <email>kstars-devel@kde."
"org</email>. Također možete koristiti automatsko izvještavanje greški alat, "
"dostupna iz izbornika Pomoć."

